  "description": "Augusto holds a PhD in Mathematics from ETH-Zürich and a degree in Physics; he is also a Professor at the Institute of Pure and Applied Mathematics (IMPA) in Rio de Janeiro. Augusto is one of the co-founders of the crypto project Cartesi, an L2 solution empowering computationally intensive DApp chains."
